CBMipgFBVV95cUxPenJPQ04zLWw2WU1yRk9OOUZiXzNzOGJjNjdjX2hpVFRQajdyQnZYV3J0cjhzV2hmeUZvT0xTQy0zVHBLUUhyWTF2UFRUbEo1X01aN3plVzEtN1czNUlVQ2J5VXdUdGg0ZmRmV3JkWFJXVkhHZzJOSU9YQThYTUVnWVFTdnJxNFBibXJabm9yWW1uSGVpNENIVWlCb2dJeW9iSHdQUEJB?oc=5","date":"2026-10-17","zh":"Lucid Group 計劃裁員約 18%"},{"title":"Lucid Group (LCID) Institutional Ownership 2026 $LCID","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE50TWZvZWxKRW9RVVkzeHR2cmRuV3B0V0FnMjhITGVwY3BnLTQydTRZd3FsMEZCUmVJZHprRncxaGphcWRIdk51UVR5S2JmakduZW5sdGVHX3pSOXRoeExpbUVFaDZPTXFUeEViU3RGaWtYVFBvejY1N1F3?oc=5","date":"2026-10-16","zh":"Lucid Group (LCID) 機構擁有 2026 $LCID"}],"themes":[{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1811210/000162828026011053/lcid-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Lucid is a technology company that is shaping the future of mobility through its innovations, advanced technology, and software-defined vehicle platforms. The company's award-winning Lucid Air and Lucid Gravity set new standards with their unmatched combination of performance, range, space, and efficiency. Additionally, through our collaboration with leading market and technology partners, Lucid is leveraging its advanced software and hardware architecture to power the next generation of advanced driver assistance system (\"ADAS\") and true eyes-off, hands-off, and mind-off (\"Level 4\") autonomous mobility systems for consumer and ride-hailing applications.","zh":"Lucid 是一家科技公司，透過其創新、先進技術和軟體定義的車輛平台塑造移動出行的未來。該公司屢獲殊榮的 Lucid Air 和 Lucid Gravity 以其無與倫比的性能、航程、空間和效率組合樹立了新標準。此外，透過與領先的市場和技術合作夥伴的合作，Lucid 正在利用其先進的軟體和硬體架構為下一代高級駕駛輔助系統 (“ADAS”) 以及真正的無眼、無手、無心（“4 級”）自主移動系統提供支持，適用於消費者和乘車應用。"},{"en":"Lucid designed, developed, manufactures and sells two groundbreaking EVs: The Lucid Air sedan, for which customer deliveries began in late 2021, and the Lucid Gravity SUV, which arrived on the road in late 2024. Each product has advanced the state-of-the-art with technical achievements, innovations, and superlatives in performance, energy efficiency, electrical architecture, software, design, and manufacturing. Our Company's unique and holistic approach to vehicle design and integration is aided by highly efficient miniaturized drivetrain components, which enables the Lucid Space Concept. This uniquely allows Lucid to merge a smaller exterior footprint with leading interior space, providing better comfort and more capacity for luggage or gear than other vehicles of similar size. We plan to expand our vehicle lineup with the upcoming Midsize platform vehicles, which are scheduled to start","zh":"Lucid 設計、開發、製造和銷售兩款突破性的電動車：Lucid Air 轎車（於 2021 年底開始向客戶交付）和 Lucid Gravity SUV（於 2024 年底上路）。每款產品都在性能、能源效率、電氣架構、軟體、設計和製造方面透過技術成就、創新和最先進的技術成就、創新和最先進的技術提升了最先進的水平。我們公司獨特的整體車輛設計和整合方法得到了高效微型傳動系統組件的幫助，從而實現了 Lucid Space 概念。這使得 Lucid 能夠將較小的外部佔地面積與領先的內部空間融為一體，與其他類似尺寸的車輛相比，提供更好的舒適度和更大的行李或裝備容量。我們計劃透過即將推出的中型平台車輛來擴大我們的車輛陣容，這些車輛計劃於"},{"en":"Lucid (i) designs, engineers and manufactures EVs, EV powertrains, and battery systems in-house, using our equipment and factories, (ii) designs and develops proprietary software in-house for Lucid vehicles that is continuously enhanced through over-the-air (\"OTA\") software updates, (iii) offers an elevated customer experience at geographically distributed retail and service locations and through direct-to-consumer online sales, (iv) builds strategic partnerships in an effort to accelerate growth and expand into new markets such as robotaxis, and (v) boasts a strong product roadmap of future vehicle programs and technologies. Our focus on in-house hardware and software innovation, vertical integration, and a \"clean sheet\" approach to engineering and design led to the development of the award-winning Lucid Air and Lucid Gravity, and upcoming Midsize platform.","zh":"Lucid (i) 使用我們的設備和工廠在內部設計、設計和製造電動汽車、電動汽車動力總成和電池系統，(ii) 為 Lucid 車輛設計和開發內部專有軟體，並透過無線（「OTA」）軟體更新不斷增強該軟體，(iii) 在地理分佈的零售和服務地點以及透過無線（「OTA」）軟體更新不斷增強該軟體，(iii) 在地理分佈的零售和服務地點以及透過直接面向消費者的線上成長擁有強大的未來車輛計畫和技術產品路線圖。我們專注於內部硬體和軟體創新、垂直整合以及「全新」的工程和設計方法，從而開發了屢獲殊榮的 Lucid Air 和 Lucid Gravity，以及即將推出的中型平台。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our EV product offerings benefit our customers and communities through zero local emissions and significantly lower emissions over their lifetime when compared to internal combustion engine (\"ICE\") vehicles. The market is still nascent, with an estimated 16% and 8% of new passenger vehicle sales for 2025 being battery electric vehicles (\"BEV\") worldwide and in North America, respectively (figures are estimates from S&P Global).","zh":"與內燃機（「ICE」）車輛相比，我們的電動車產品透過零本地排放以及在其整個生命週期內顯著降低排放，使我們的客戶和社區受益。該市場仍處於起步階段，預計 2025 年全球和北美新乘用車銷量的 16% 和 8% 是純電動車 (“BEV”)（數據來自 S&P Global 的估計）。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We face competition from both traditional automotive OEMs and newer companies focused on electric and other alternative fuel vehicles. We expect this competition to increase, particularly as the transportation sector continues to shift towards low-emission, zero-emission, or carbon neutral solutions. We believe the recent proposal to lower the U.S. federal fuel economy standards could have the market effect of reducing pressure on other automakers to innovate, leading them to scale back EV and efficiency investments and thereby creating a long-term competitive advantage and market opportunity for Lucid.","zh":"我們面臨來自傳統汽車原始設備製造商和專注於電動和其他替代燃料汽車的新興公司的競爭。我們預計這種競爭將會加劇，特別是隨著交通運輸業繼續轉向低排放、零排放或碳中和解決方案。我們認為，最近降低美國聯邦燃油經濟性標準的提議可能會產生市場效應，減輕其他汽車製造商的創新壓力，導致他們縮減電動車和效率投資，從而為 Lucid 創造長期競爭優勢和市場機會。"},{"en":"The Lucid Air, the Lucid Gravity, and the upcoming Midsize platform vehicles are expected to compete with both traditional luxury internal combustion vehicles from established automotive OEMs and electric and other alternative fuel vehicles from both new manufacturers and established automotive OEMs, many of which have entered or have announced plans to enter the alternative fuel and EV market. Many major automobile manufacturers, including luxury automobile manufacturers, have EVs available today, and other current and prospective automobile manufacturers are also developing EVs. In addition, numerous manufacturers offer hybrid vehicles, including plug-in versions, with which our vehicles also compete.","zh":"Lucid Air、Lucid Gravity 和即將推出的中型平台車輛預計將與成熟汽車原始設備製造商的傳統豪華內燃機汽車以及新製造商和成熟汽車原始設備製造商的電動和其他替代燃料汽車競爭，其中許多製造商已經進入或宣布計劃進入替代燃料和電動汽車市場。如今，包括豪華汽車製造商在內的許多主要汽車製造商都推出了電動車，其他當前和未來的汽車製造商也在開發電動車。此外，許多製造商提供混合動力汽車，包括插電式版本，我們的車輛也與之競爭。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Vehicle Sales From E Vs","val":1183800000,"zh":"電動汽車銷量"},{"name":"Regulatory Credits","val":96000000,"zh":"監理積分"},{"name":"Sale & Leaseback Transactions","val":70900000,"zh":"售後回租交易"}],"total":1353790000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":1166729000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":1142400000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Middle East","val":163556000,"zh":"中東"},{"name":"SA","val":161800000,"zh":"SA"},{"name":"Other International","val":23505000,"zh":"其他國際"}],"total":1353790000}},"peers":["RIVN","NIO","XPEV","CHPT","QS"]}}